Error [E0105]: `same name` is defined twice
  --> tests/ui/test_duplicate_name.jet:5:7
    |
  5 | #Test("same name") {
    |       ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Every test needs a unique name so failures are easy to find
 Fix: Rename or remove one of the definitions
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0105

Error [E0101]: This program has no `run` function
 Why: Running a program starts at `fn run`, and the entry file doesn't define one
 Fix: Add `fn run() { ... }` to the entry file
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0101
